<title>USA: IPO PRICING - NeoMagic prices above range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - NeoMagic prices above range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			NeoMagic Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $12</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		$9 - $11</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			3,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		 Morgan Stanley</p>
<p>NOTE: The company raised the proposed price range for its planned initial public offering to $9 to $11 from its original estimated price range of $7 to $9.</p>
</text>
